  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Keshav Gautam Alias Aman vs State Govt. Of Nct Of Delhi And Ors on 22 August, 2024 Author: Prathiba M. Singh Bench: Prathiba M. Singh, Amit Sharma $~10 * In The High Court Of Delhi At New Delhi + W.P.(Crl) 1225/2024 Keshav Gautam Alias Aman Through: Petitioner in versus State Govt. Of Nct Of Delhi And Ors. .... Through: Mr. Sanjay La (Crl.) wit Mr. Abhina Mr. Rakesh with Mr. D Vijay Laxm Harsh Gupt Paras Posw 5 & 6 in p Coram: Justice Prathiba M. Singh Justice Amit Sharma Order % 22.08.2024 1. This hearing has been done through hybrid mode. 2. The present writ petition was filed by Keshav Gautam @ Aman Gautam son of Sh. Rajendra Gautam under Article 226 of the Constitution of India read with Section 482 Cr.P.C. seeking issuance of a writ in the nature of habeas corpus seeking production of his father Sh. Rajendra Gautam. 3. Vide order dated 23rd April, 2024, the Court recorded as under:- This is a digitally signed order.",
    "facts": "The allegation in the petition was that his mother i.e., Divya Gautam-Respondent No.5 was ill-treating his father and that the mother and sister i.e., Nishtha Gautam- Respondent No.6 had connived with a doctor and were administering sedatives to the Petitioner's father. The further apprehension was that the father, who is specially abled was being kept in illegal confinement. To the extent court case was filed against me under Mental Health Act 101, 102, 103 by mother and police harassed me saying I should get proper treatment to improve my conduct. In FIR No. 72/2024, the Petitioner had surrendered on 16th August, 2024 and on 17th August, 2024 he was granted bail.",
    "arguments": "6. The petitioner has averred that respondents Nos. 5, 6 and 7 are hatching conspiracy to eliminate his father and grab his properties and are also preventing him to meet his father. Hence, a prayer is made to direct the respondents to produce his father, who has been secretly kept at some place by respondents Nos. 5 and 6 so that he could ensure his father's safety and life.\" 4."
  },
